(7139688, 1094211, 91496, '<td valign="top">Cool location for Waldo.  I really like the graphic nature.  <br/> <br/>The border merges with the black areas on the edge of the frame and thus detracts rather than helps your image.  It is also wider than the internal white columns and becomes part of the graphic rather than accenting it.  Either a thin line white border or no border would have worked better.</td>', 'Cool location for Waldo.  I really like the graphic nature.   The border merges with the black areas on the edge of the frame and thus detracts rather than helps your image.  It is also wider than the internal white columns and becomes part of the graphic rather than accenting it.  Either a thin line white border or no border would have worked better.', '2013-12-06 18:13:31.000000', NULL, 1),
