(7141757, 1094211, 68769, '<td valign="top">I see the obvious one on the left side 6 down, but I think I see 2-3 people right center 3 up from bottom. Maybe Jeff will confirm with full sized image.</td>', 'I see the obvious one on the left side 6 down, but I think I see 2-3 people right center 3 up from bottom. Maybe Jeff will confirm with full sized image.', '2013-12-11 22:40:19.000000', NULL, 0),
