(7141812, 1094114, 12611, '<td valign="top">When it comes through, (and it takes a while and it''s own thread) but when you finally see it, it''s quite creepy and very well done. <i>Really nice job</i>. You went over the heads and beyond the attention span of most viewers. When has it ever mattered, to the creative and the innovative, what the masses think?</td>', 'When it comes through, (and it takes a while and it''s own thread) but when you finally see it, it''s quite creepy and very well done. Really nice job. You went over the heads and beyond the attention span of most viewers. When has it ever mattered, to the creative and the innovative, what the masses think?', '2013-12-12 08:29:26.000000', NULL, 0),
